ficial intelligence and metaverse for healthy food and skin health#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#A cross-sectional study of the artificial intelligence and metaverse for healthy food and skin health#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[39,40],"#A cross-sectional study of the artificial intelligence and metaverse for healthy food and skin health#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42],"#A cross-sectional study of the artificial intelligence and metaverse for healthy food and skin health#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)#{1}":[42,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/ADQH3JAE","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/K3Q8JRZ9?page=1&annotation=E97NNV8P","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/K3Q8JRZ9?page=1&annotation=FRGNRMGH","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 11","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/K3Q8JRZ9?page=11&annotation=DXYRAUJM","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 2","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/K3Q8JRZ9?page=2&annotation=UNKZNB2U","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 11","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/K3Q8JRZ9?page=11&annotation=SRAK3IJI","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 5","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/K3Q8JRZ9?page=5&annotation=X4YVZ8GJ","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 2","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/K3Q8JRZ9?page=2&annotation=5338NJN5","line":39},{"title":"Sayfa 10","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/K3Q8JRZ9?page=10&annotation=GGQW5RBY","line":42}],"metadata":{"Title":"A cross-sectional study of the artificial intelligence and metaverse for healthy food and skin health","Authors":"Jinkyung Lee, Ki Han Kwon","Year":2025,"DOI":"10.21037/jmai-24-189","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"Background: This study investigated nutritional information for a healthy and beautiful life of Koreans, focusing on the need for diet and nutritional supplements for each disease according to health status based on big data in 2012 when the swine flu was prevalent.Post-COVID-19, research on health should be conducted systematically, and nutrition education and product development for sustainable health and beautiful life should be conducted worldwide. This study was conducted to find out health information by age group for artificial intelligence (AI) and metaverse app development in the Web 3.0 era, reflecting the interest in and need for healthy living, beauty information, and functional diet as infectious diseases are recurring around the world.  Methods: This study was conducted using data from the 5th Korea National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey (KNHANES V-3) in 2012. Nutrition information was surveyed on 7,214 people aged 1 year or older.This study was conducted to find out health information by age group for artificial intelligence (AI) and metaverse app development in the Web 3.0 era, reflecting the interest in and need for healthy living, beauty information, and functional diet as infectious diseases are recurring around the worldThis research was conducted to find out health information by age group for AI and metaverse app development in the Web 3.0 era for sustainable life, cosmetology, and for treating the dermatological disorders for people around the worl","Findings":"In addition, by developing content in AI and the metaverse in the Web 3.0 era, the possibility of continuous improvement and development of sustainable living, beauty, and dermatological diseases for people around the world was confirmed.Finally, AI and the metaverse have been utilized in various fields of health and beauty digitally.","Conclusions":"It is essential for continuous improvement and development of AI healthcare so that research on telemedicine technology and customer experience can be conducted freely within the Web 3.0 metaverse","Limitations":"Second, there is a lack of clinical and practical research on the potential of new technologies that can improve health and beauty by utilizing AI and the metaverse.","User_Notes":"anlamadım bu çalışmayı AI ile ne alaka?"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1s4p43k","at":1774939663134}},"smart_blocks:leeCrosssectionalStudyArtificial2025.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.00865263,0.00167864,0.05713847,0.02387774,0.05637827,0.01443771,-0.01162574,0.02983576,-0.01007279,0.00952692,0.00403869,-0.08176012,0.04821384,0.04037202,0.02319803,0.00796198,0.03806596,-0.04122023,-0.05176329,0.02497117,0.0647785,-0.01843041,0.01574998,-0.0329627,0.02574749,0.02285437,-0.0151732,-0.03192758,-0.06891628,-0.18347292,0.00128997,-0.02920381,0.0763742,0.0240517,-0.0833611,0.02434738,0.02339985,0.06723529,-0.0652504,0.0362545,0.03211885,0.01700482,0.0475714,0.01309161,0.013358,0.00317564,-0.06450531,-0.00461889,-0.02526553,-0.01607483,-0.03319785,-0.02412092,0.03111526,0.07531096,0.0455614,0.06098764,0.00300672,0.05135706,0.02563058,0.07852835,0.03709562,0.01873562,-0.19196363,0.11417586,0.01510016,0.02972864,-0.05534459,-0.02846322,0.05742257,-0.05814875,-0.06024772,0.00556108,0.03778274,0.01082782,0.04576544,0.02485604,0.03058619,-0.07746145,0.02879519,-0.05053618,0.01993581,0.10934087,0.00680357,0.00577557,-0.07477619,-0.02130318,-0.05601966,-0.08288597,0.03501139,-0.01544957,0.0000786,-0.000708,-0.00517251,0.00079644,-0.0146728,-0.0547651,-0.00748243,0.01912595,-0.01689222,0.12143506,-0.0591033,-0.05132551,0.01478556,0.00840389,0.05681634,-0.06607649,-0.05797439,-0.05678309,-0.00100995,0.03264278,-0.01931969,0.02685002,-0.01006709,-0.01071132,-0.03591753,0.00868422,0.07588795,0.00075722,0.03656678,-0.04796455,-0.01650108,0.02696947,0.08234759,-0.01431683,0.010471,0.00698197,0.0307927,0.03862008,0.01911755,-0.01015939,0.09376889,-0.00626343,-0.07313147,-0.00328155,-0.04194545,-0.0210014,-0.00486977,-0.02235032,-0.00617208,0.0134671,-0.03276101,-0.02200753,0.03759521,-0